# ── School ERP frontend configuration ────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) if you need to override anything. Vite only
# exposes variables prefixed with VITE_.

# Backend API base URL, including the /api suffix.
#
# LEAVE THIS UNSET for local and LAN development. When unset, src/constants/index.ts
# derives the URL from the page's own hostname at request time
# (`${protocol}//${hostname}:5000/api`), which works for both localhost and a phone
# on the same Wi-Fi and never goes stale. Hardcoding a LAN IP here breaks the app
# the next time this machine's DHCP lease changes.
#
# Only set it to point at a genuinely different backend (staging/production):
# VITE_API_URL=https://erp.example.com/api
